{
 "encounter_id": "00949",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Doctor, I'm having a hernia repair next month, and the surgeon wants a heart check first, and I'm a bit nervous about it, honestly."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's perfectly normal before an operation. Tell me about your heart. Any problems that you've noticed? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I get a bit puffed on the stairs. Two flights and I'm blowing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long has that been the case? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A while now. Since I put on weight, I'd say. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any chest pain on exertion?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No chest pain. Not at all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Palpitations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No palpitations."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you fainted, or nearly fainted?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Never fainted, no."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What tablets are you taking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ramipril, 5 mg, once a day. Atorvastatin, 20 mg, at night. And aspirin, 75 mg, in the morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Any heart history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure. For ten years."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any procedures on your heart?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "They put in a stent, in 2020."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right. Let me take your numbers. Pulse 66, blood pressure 132 over 80, temperature 36.5, oxygen 97 percent, breathing 14, and weight 97 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that all right? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "All fine. Let me listen to your heart.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Take your time. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Heart sounds are normal, regular rhythm."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Does that mean I'm okay for the surgery? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I can't promise that yet. The breathlessness on the stairs could simply be weight and fitness, but I can't rule out that it's coming from the heart."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh. That's not what I wanted to hear. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I know. But it's better to know before the operation than after. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "True. What happens now? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll write to the surgeon with what I've found today and ask them to hold the date until I've seen you again. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Will it delay the surgery? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Possibly by a short time. It's much safer than rushing. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I suppose so. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "In the meantime, keep taking all your tablets, including the aspirin, and keep walking each day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in two weeks, before the date."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two weeks. Thanks, doctor. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Don't worry. You're in good hands. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I hope so. ~"
  }
 ],
